OL,3,GNEWSAModular homes for temporary
OL,4,Ahousing nearly complete
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new development to provide temporary
OL,7,Faccommodation to help families and
OL,8,Findividuals facing homelessness is
OL,9,Fnearly complete.
OL,11,FThe purpose-built scheme will deliver
OL,12,F38 two-bedroom apartments at a former
OL,13,Fschool site off Billing Brook Road in
OL,14,FNorthampton.
OL,16,FThe plans were signed off earlier this
OL,17,Fyear despite Northampton Academy
OL,18,Fraising concerns the homes would
OL,19,Foverlook a playground - creating a
OL,20,Fsafeguarding issue.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
