OL,3,GNEWSAModular homes for temporary
OL,4,Ahousing nearly complete
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharlie Hastie, deputy leader and
OL,7,Fcabinet member for housing at West
OL,8,FNorthamptonshire Council, said: "These
OL,9,Fnew homes will provide modern,
OL,10,Fenergy-efficient accommodation that
OL,11,Foffers people dignity, stability and
OL,12,Fsecurity at a difficult time in their
OL,13,Flives."
